# 依副檔名對應 git 內建的 funcname driver（git help gitattributes「Defining a custom hunk-header」）。
# 只列這批 PR 會出現、且 git 有內建 driver 的語言；JS／TS／Swift 沒有內建 driver，不列。
# 以 core.attributesFile 傳入，優先序低於 repo 自己的 .gitattributes。
*.cs diff=csharp
*.razor diff=csharp
*.py diff=python
*.pyi diff=python
*.rs diff=rust
*.c diff=cpp
*.h diff=cpp
*.cc diff=cpp
*.cpp diff=cpp
*.hpp diff=cpp
*.go diff=golang
*.java diff=java
*.kt diff=kotlin
*.rb diff=ruby
*.php diff=php
*.m diff=objc
*.css diff=css
*.html diff=html
*.md diff=markdown
*.mdx diff=markdown
*.sh diff=bash
